  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gonugunta Venkata Suresh vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 18 January, 2022 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.59 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner is the accused in C.C.No.700 of 2018 on the file of the learned Additional Judicial Magistrate of First Class, Kavali, SPSR Nellore District. He has been facing prosecution for the offences punishable under Section 353 IPC and under Section 58 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. This is a covered matter in view of the earlier orders passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch and in Criminal Petition No.2966 of 2021 and batch whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] similar proceedings registered for the similar offences based on identical facts.",
